OL,3,GNEWSASouthport killer accused of
OL,4,Athrowing boiling water mixed with sugar
OL,5,Aat prison officer
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouthport killer Axel Rudakubana has
OL,8,Fappeared in court accused of throwing
OL,9,Fboiling water mixed with sugar at a
OL,10,Fprison officer.
OL,12,FThe 20-year-old is charged with the
OL,13,Fattempted grievous bodily harm of a
OL,14,Fprison officer at HMP Belmarsh, having
OL,15,Fallegedly thrown the boiling mix
OL,16,Fthrough the hatch in his cell door on 8
OL,17,FMay last year.
OL,19,FHe is also charged with two other
OL,20,Fassaults of prison officers, as well as
OL,21,Fpossession of a knife or other
OL,22,Foffensive weapon while in prison.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
